1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,587
Fluffy rice every time, with three simple
rules.

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:04,345
One.

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:07,804
Rinse the rice until the water runs mostly
clear.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:08,672
Two.

5
00:00:09,033 --> 00:00:11,136
Use one cup of rice to one and

6
00:00:11,146 --> 00:00:12,654
a half cups of water.

7
00:00:13,456 --> 00:00:17,800
Boil, stir once, cover, and simmer on

8
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:18,552
low.

9
00:00:18,767 --> 00:00:19,451
Three.

10
00:00:19,626 --> 00:00:20,902
Don't lift the lid.

11
00:00:21,193 --> 00:00:23,586
Rest off the heat for ten minutes, then

12
00:00:23,596 --> 00:00:24,954
fluff with a fork.

13
00:00:25,167 --> 00:00:28,022
The full seven-step guide is on the
channel.

14
00:00:28,255 --> 00:00:31,818
Follow WikiTube for a new how-to every
day.
